 5. 📺 Scoop: Trump sought Bartiromo 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Maria Bartiromo in June. Photo: Paul Morigi/Getty Images

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Before hiring Katie Zacharia for her five-day stint as White House press secretary, President Trump wanted to recruit former Fox News host Maria Bartiromo, two administration sources told Axios' Marc Caputo. 

 Bartiromo, who was bounced from Fox's air last month but is still being paid under her contract, signaled she wasn't going to take the job. "She's no longer on air, but she's still on the Fox payroll and the taxpayers can't compete with that," a source told us.

 Conservative commentator Scott Jennings was in contention but wasn't offered the job. Go deeper . 

 
 
