 7. 💰 Time capsule: Ballroom donors revealed 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Yesterday's Washington Post front page . Secret records obtained by The Washington Post ( gift link ) reveal $333 million in donations from corporations and billionaires bankrolling the White House ballroom.

 The list includes donors who benefited from government contracts, regulatory decisions and a presidential pardon involving a family member. 🎁 The biggest corporate donors include Apple ($25m), Nvidia ($25m), Microsoft ($10m), Palantir ($10m) and Lockheed Martin ($10m).

